# Claude Code workspace. Narrow ignore: the rest of .claude/ stays tracked, so
# shared agent config (csw.json) is versioned with the repo. Matches trakrf/infra.
# Git worktrees — Claude Code's native worktree tool writes here (see CLAUDE.md)
.claude/worktrees/
